{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03230",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.06,
      "end_seconds": 3.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "right, thanks for waiting, come in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.61,
      "end_seconds": 8.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.54,
      "end_seconds": 12.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "What's the main thing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.27,
      "end_seconds": 20.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "I've been dealing with a limp my sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.84,
      "end_seconds": 26.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.96,
      "end_seconds": 30.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "It's been five days, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.91,
      "end_seconds": 34.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "how strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.12,
      "end_seconds": 43.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly. And night pain, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.83,
      "end_seconds": 49.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Has there been pain in your groin and hip too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.6,
      "end_seconds": 51.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Mm, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.88,
      "end_seconds": 58.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Have you had a limp before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.5,
      "end_seconds": 64.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "I had a similar thing last year. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 65.59,
      "end_seconds": 72.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pulse 67, temperature 36.7, blood pressure 126 over 71."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.56,
      "end_seconds": 73.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.26,
      "end_seconds": 78.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.48,
      "end_seconds": 81.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "sure thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.76,
      "end_seconds": 84.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.31,
      "end_seconds": 99.53,
      "duration_seconds": 7.22,
      "text": "Hip rotation is painful and limited and you have a limp favouring the right side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.81,
      "end_seconds": 104.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.48,
      "end_seconds": 123.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "did you get weight loss, fever, fall or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.47,
      "end_seconds": 127.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.75,
      "end_seconds": 131.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.57,
      "end_seconds": 133.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "no rashes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.52,
      "end_seconds": 139.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "right, do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.43,
      "end_seconds": 142.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Paracetamol, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.09,
      "end_seconds": 146.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.68,
      "end_seconds": 152.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "It's 650 milligrams. It's spironolactone, 25 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.37,
      "end_seconds": 159.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.51,
      "end_seconds": 163.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "yes, grass pollen i get sneezing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.91,
      "end_seconds": 169.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.8,
      "end_seconds": 183.11,
      "duration_seconds": 11.31,
      "text": "I have arthritis in my knees sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit i've had heart failure for five years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.8,
      "end_seconds": 194.84,
      "duration_seconds": 10.04,
      "text": "Sure. Right, so arthritis in your knees and heart failure are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.17,
      "end_seconds": 208.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.96,
      "end_seconds": 214.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.69,
      "end_seconds": 218.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.76,
      "end_seconds": 228.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.5,
      "end_seconds": 232.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.41,
      "end_seconds": 236.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.09,
      "end_seconds": 260.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? My working impression is hip osteoarthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.87,
      "end_seconds": 264.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.01,
      "end_seconds": 293.41,
      "duration_seconds": 27.4,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now hip osteoarthritis is my leading thought, not anything worse. I'll request an X-ray of the hips, it'll help with hip pain. You'll be taking naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day with food, two weeks. You take it by mouth. That's for hip pain. Use a walking stick in the left hand and do gentle strengthening exercises."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.78,
      "end_seconds": 311.63,
      "duration_seconds": 17.85,
      "text": "sure. I think the the orthopaedic clinic should see you too. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.91,
      "end_seconds": 315.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.0,
      "end_seconds": 317.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}